      "description": "<p>This mod adds an extra grenade called BigBoomGrenade (BBG)</p>\n<p>It has a short fuse, just like my mate Dazza. A big explosion radius with LOTS of shrapnel.</p>\n<p>It’s perfect for shredding enemies before they have a chance to run away, just don’t get too close!!</p>\n<p>It is based from code by Echo55 and LumurkFox “PineappleBlitz”, so big thanks to them. I wouldn’t have known where</p>\n<p>to start otherwise.</p>\n<p>Just drop the file into the user/mods folder</p>\n<p>Settings can be adjusted within the src\\config folder and opening the config.ts file using Notepad++</p>\n",
